{"id":"64f7040a336579ec","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-sub-sigma-algebra.md","title":"Sub-Sigma Algebra","display":"df-sub-sigma-algebra — Sub-Sigma Algebra","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-sub-sigma-algebra","aliases":["58-df-sub-sigma-algebra","Sub-Sigma Algebra"],"display":"df-sub-sigma-algebra — Sub-Sigma Algebra","depends_on":["[[58-df-sigma-algebra]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-sub-sigma-algebra"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-sub-sigma-algebra</span><span>Sub-Sigma Algebra</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sub-sigma-algebra — Sub-Sigma Algebra"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"58-df-sigma-algebra\">58-df-sigma-algebra</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X, \\mathcal{F})\">\\((X, \\mathcal{F})\\)</span> (measurable space)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{G} \\subseteq \\mathcal{F}\">\\(\\mathcal{G} \\subseteq \\mathcal{F}\\)</span> (subset of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F}\">\\(\\mathcal{F}\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\">\\(\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\\)</span> (sigma-algebra predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"58-df-sigma-algebra\">58-df-sigma-algebra</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubSigmaAlgebra}\">\\(\\operatorname{SubSigmaAlgebra}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sub\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}algebra} \\vdash\n\\operatorname{SubSigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal G,\\mathcal F,X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F,X)\\land\\mathcal G\\subseteq\\mathcal F\\land\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal G,X)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sub\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}algebra} \\vdash\n\\operatorname{SubSigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal G,\\mathcal F,X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F,X)\\land\\mathcal G\\subseteq\\mathcal F\\land\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal G,X)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Sub-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>-algebra: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>-algebra contained in larger <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>-algebra; less information</li>\n<li>Filtration: increasing sequence <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F}_t\">\\(\\mathcal{F}_t\\)</span> of sub-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>-algebras; information growing</li>\n<li>A product <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>-algebra lives on a product space and does not by itself assert independence.</li>\n<li>Conditional expectation relative to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal G\">\\(\\mathcal G\\)</span> and its existence theorem belong to separate measure-theoretic atoms.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Williams, Probability with Martingales</li>\n<li>Durrett, Probability: Theory and Examples</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-sigma-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-sigma-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-sigma-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}$ (sigma-algebra predicate, see [[58-df-sigma-algebra]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(X, \\mathcal{F})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{G} \\subseteq \\mathcal{F}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{F}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SubSigmaAlgebra}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sub\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}algebra} \\vdash\n\\operatorname{SubSigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal G,\\mathcal F,X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F,X)\\land\\mathcal G\\subseteq\\mathcal F\\land\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal G,X)","display":true},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{F}_t","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal G","display":false}],"bytes":1388,"backlinks":[{"id":"a17a46f7f2ffbbf8","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1243","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-sub-sigma-algebra.md|58-df-sub-sigma-algebra]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["a740bdad87b97ac6"]}